sessions
*.md
!**/README.md
.vscode
.idea

# Local env files hold real secrets. `COPY . .` and `COPY packages/database` would bake
# one into an image built on a developer machine, so keep them out of the context at
# every depth; the .env.example template stays (the last matching line wins).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
